      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math>",
